     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当南国的海风裹挟着熟悉的牵挂吹过珠江岸、香江边，绍兴一中的寻访脚步跨越山海，落在了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">广州、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深圳与香港这片校友云集的热土上。为</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">顺利推进</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校130周年校庆</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的筹备工作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2026年7月14日—7月19日，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市教育局党委副书记、绍兴一中党委书记丁初效</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，校长蒋明和我校校友会会长王卫列、基金会理事长朱雯，以及副校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱水军</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教育局基教处副处长丁弘正</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党政办主任刘明玉等一行</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奔赴</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大湾区（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">广州、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深圳、香港），带着母校的惦念与百年学府的情怀，赴一场与</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">友好学校、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中校友的温暖之约。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>走访</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>南粤名校</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> 共话育人初心</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7月1</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日，走访团</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经上海社科院马学强教授牵线介绍</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来到广州</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">佛山石门中学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">访问交流</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">石门中学党委书记田冬冬、校长张国君、党委委员沈敏姬、校办主任肖朝云等出席接待并座谈交流。</span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201625491238.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201625491238.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201625514114.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201625514114.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">园里随处蕴含着育人的匠心，校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">际交流的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">畅谈</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">里满是思维的火花，大家一同参观校园、座谈创新人才培养，共同商议成立沪浙粤校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">际</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">联盟的相关事宜，把一中深耕教育的初心，在跨地域的协作里延伸出更长远的脉络。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201626217870.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201626217870.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201626248119.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201626248119.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201626240046.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201626240046.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">据悉，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">佛山石门中学始建于1932年，是扎根珠江之滨的岭南百年名校，也是首批广东省一级学校、国家级示范性普通高中。近年</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来，该校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高考成绩持续稳居全省第一梯队，2026年预计25人超清华北大录取线，另有3人提前锁定保送资格</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学科竞赛实力同样突出，信息学竞赛累计超120人获全国一等奖，获奖人数长期位居广东前列</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拔尖创新人才培养成果稳居全省第一方阵。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>深圳</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>拜访</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：鉴湖情怀在创新热土上共鸣</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7月16日，走访团从佛山出发抵达深圳，第一站便奔赴香港中文大学（深圳），拜访</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1975届校友、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中国工程院院士</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港中文大学（深圳）徐扬生校长。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201626529728.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201626529728.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627042267.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627042267.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627012501.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627012501.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627026618.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627026618.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当天上午的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校园参观</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与座谈环节</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，香港中文大学（深圳）</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校长助理陈恒博士、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港中文大学（深圳）</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">浙江招生组负责人马明霞博士，以及多位我校毕业的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港中文大学（深圳）</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在读学子陪同接待。自</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港中文大学（深圳）</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">建校招生以来，绍兴一中每年均有较多学子考入该校，我校师生、家长也与马明霞博士建立了深厚的情谊，一中学子带着对徐扬生院士学长的景仰和对学校别具一格校园的向往，走入</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港中文大学（深圳）</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，求索深造，淬炼成才。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627268875.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627268875.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627269902.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627269902.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627261773.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627261773.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627264929.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627264929.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中午，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">徐扬生校长的明园家中，徐院士以家宴款待走访团一行。大家围桌畅谈，乡音乡情、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一字一句</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">都藏着从未褪色的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">母校师生情谊和一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青春印记</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。交流中，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">徐</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">院士</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大家签名赠书</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">并</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">欣然接</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">受母校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“绍兴一中校史博物馆名誉馆长”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“绍兴一中深圳校友会名誉会长”等聘书。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201627439374.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201627439374.jpg" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当日傍晚</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在深圳福田区，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中深圳校友会联谊活动暖意融融</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">来自不同届别的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深圳</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校友围坐在一起，聊起校园旧事，谈起伏案苦读的高中时光，哪怕毕业数十载，一句“我是一中人”，就足以消解所有距离。绍兴一中深圳校友会</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会长兼大湾区校友联络处负责人胡栋梁精心组织了联谊活动，并在佛山、深圳两地走访时全程陪同。聚会当晚，他郑重接过母校聘书，并谈了今后有关活动设想。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>香江</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>聚首</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：共话刻在青春里的一中印记</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7月17</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">-18</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明、朱雯、王卫列、朱水军、刘明玉一行</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">跨过深圳河抵达香港，接连的走访行程里藏着</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">浓浓</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校友牵挂：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201628260459.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201628260459.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201628281070.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201628281070.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">17日的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第一站，在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港科学仪器社有限公司</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，走访团</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拜访了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">公司总经理、香港浙江省同乡会联合会第一常务副会长车</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">弘健先生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校杰出校友、校教育基金会发起人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">车越乔之子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，车弘健先生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">承载着两代人对</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中的深厚情谊</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。在交流中，蒋明校长深切缅怀了车越乔老先生生前多次捐赠母校的大爱壮举，感谢车氏父子两代人对学校做出的贡献。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201629014659.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201629014659.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201628574679.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201628574679.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201628576888.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201628576888.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">车弘健受聘担任学校“绍兴市第一中学教育基金会名誉理事长”“绍兴一中香港校友会名誉会长”，并驱车带领走访团一行参观了香港浙江省同乡会联合会驻地。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201629235393.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201629235393.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201629264798.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201629264798.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴旅港同乡会驻地，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">走访团拜访了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴旅港同乡会常务副会长、香港超时代光源有限公司总经理</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">20</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">01届校友毛宇峰</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。毛宇峰向母校来访团介绍了同乡会的有关活动情况，并深情回顾了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当年在一中的求学往事。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拜访期间，因公出差在外的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴旅港同乡会会长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">严建国校友还专程来电问候，蒋明校长深表感谢，并致意慰问。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201629529798.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201629529798.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201630033733.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201630033733.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201630042130.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201630042130.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201629594264.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201629594264.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当晚</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在毛宇峰校友精心组织的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">香港校友会联谊活动上，新老校友围坐畅谈，鉴湖的水与香江的浪，在一声声乡音里汇到了一起</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，校友们一一介绍了自己的工作（学习）情况，交流在港生活的种种感受，氛围热烈感人。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631068787.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631068787.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631050792.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631050792.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631001285.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631001285.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孙新荣校友受聘担任“绍兴一中香港校友会会长”，毛宇峰校友受聘担任“绍兴一中香港校友会副会长”，王李俊校友受聘担任“绍兴一中香港校友会秘书长”。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">18日的走访依旧满是温情：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631254243.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631254243.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631250818.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631250818.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631269931.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631269931.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在陆羽茶社，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1985届校友高红与走访团一行围桌茶叙，畅聊今昔；在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中环</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金融大厦</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">华利安国际投资银行</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">办公室，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">19</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">84届校友</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">华利安国际投资银行董事总经理、中国区总裁陈为民，和母校来人细叙阔别经年的想念</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631482173.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631482173.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631499921.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631499921.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201631439266.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201631439266.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在中环南丰大厦拔萃资本会议室，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">19</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">85届校友</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拔萃资本创始人、董事长兼</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">总裁</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孙新荣，谈起当年在一中校园里的点滴成长，言语间满是对母校栽培的感恩。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他们向母校老师们介绍了各自在行业领域中所取得的成就，分享了各自在事业奋斗、家庭陪伴、健康呵护等方面的心得体会，并祝愿母校越办越好、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">130周年校庆圆满成功。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>百</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>卅</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>载弦歌不辍 千万里校友同心</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7月19日，走访团带着满</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">满</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的校友祝福与沉甸甸的情谊启程返</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这份跨越六天的大湾区之行，从来不是一次简单的出差走访：它是百年一中在130周年校庆前夕，递到每一位游子手中的家书，告诉所有走南闯北的一中人，母校永远在鉴湖边等你回来。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这里的每一次握手、每一张合影、每一段聊到深夜的校园旧事，都在诉说着同一个不变的共鸣：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>无论你毕业于哪一年，无论你身处世界的哪一角，只要你是一中人，你的青春故里永远在绍兴那方飘着墨香的校园里。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>我们也在此诚挚邀约所有校友，常回一中看看，共赴130周年校庆之约，一同续写属于我们所有人的一中故事。</strong></span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
